        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tolomut ŋakipi anataaba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towotokis Ŋisirael daadaŋ analoŋisat a ŋina a Sin, torubakis ewosete anakibois ka apei tari ŋinace, lopite ŋolo ecikitor Ekapolon ikes. Toloma ikes neni enyaritae Repidim, nai amam ŋakipi a nen ŋuna emasete ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ikes kisiburata Moses a nen temasi neni a Moses, “Inakinae isua ŋakipi tomatae.” Kiŋit Moses ikes tema, “Kaanukiro ikisiburaata iyes ayoŋ? Kaanukiro ikatakinitotor iyes Ekapolon?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyam akure ŋituŋa a nen nooi, kiŋuruŋura neni a Moses. Kiŋita Moses temasi, “Kaanukiro ikitipeunio iyoŋ isua alo Ijipit akitaar isua ka ŋidwe kosi ta ŋibaren kosi akure?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Moses kikalou neni ke Ekapolon kiŋit tema, “Nyo emaikina ayoŋ etiya neni a ŋituŋa a lu? Etenito ikes akicak ayoŋ a ŋamoru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirwor Ekapolon neni a Moses tema, “Ape tolot kiŋaren ŋituŋa, ya ŋikasikou a Ŋisirael ŋidi torukosi ka iyoŋ; totiŋ ebela kon ŋolo ibunio toramya aŋolol Nile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awoi ayoŋ alokiŋaren kon anataaba a ŋina eyai lomukura ŋolo enyaritae Oreb. Toram ataaba ŋin, elomunete ŋakipi a nen, ido tomata ŋituŋa.” Abu Moses kitiya ŋun iteete ŋikasikou a Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Moses ŋirorwa a akibois a ŋin Masa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Masa",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Masa iŋes atemar akikatakin ka Meriba,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Meriba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Meriba iŋes atemar ebura.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " anerae apotu Ŋisirael kisiburata ka kikatakis Ekapolon a nen kiŋita temasi, “Eyai mono Ekapolon kaapei ka iwon, kori mam?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Toremo Ŋiamaleki Ŋisirael, nai aponi tobwaŋae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toŋaut Ŋiamaleki ajore, toremo Ŋisirael alo Repidim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Moses neni a Yosua, “Toseu ŋikilyok ŋidi alotuŋa yok toloto kitijioto Ŋiamaleki. Awoi ayoŋ moi taparacu alokidiama emukura atiŋit ebela ŋolo ka Akuj.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Yosua kitiya ikwapei alimokinitor Moses iŋes, kitiji Ŋiamaleki apaki ŋina ayakatar Moses ka Aron ta Ur kidiama emukura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki daadaŋ ŋina ekyaaritor Moses akan keŋ, elounito Ŋisirael Ŋiamaleki; ido apaki daadaŋ ŋina etikiunio Moses akan keŋ, kilout Ŋiamaleki Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu toup Moses akikyaarit ŋakan keŋ, aŋun, apotu ŋirukitos keŋ tolemut amoru kisiboikis Moses nen. Totiŋa Aron ka Ur ŋakan a Moses kikyaasi, ipei kikyaa teten ka ŋinice kikyaa kedyeny. Aŋun, apotu ŋakan a Moses torubakis ikyaara akitodol ŋina adoiyorya akoloŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Yosua tobwaŋ Ŋiamaleki toar a ŋileŋia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Ekapolon neni a Moses, “Kigir ŋakiro nu lokitaabo ikotere etamunitae, ido tolimununuye ikes epupi Yosua, anerae esunyari ayoŋ jik Ŋiamaleki todaun ituŋanan etamunit ikes anakwap a na.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok Moses Namuroet nen tolimok ekiro keŋ ebe, “Erae Ekapolon abendera kaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema iŋes, “Ani ikyaaritae abendera ŋina ke Ekapolon, itiji Ekapolon Ŋiamaleki ŋulu a ŋanyameta a daadaŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
